@host = http://localhost:5080

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Runtime info (useful after Azure deploy)
GET {{host}}/info

### List seeded campus events
GET {{host}}/api/events

### Get one event
GET {{host}}/api/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Create event
POST {{host}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Container Apps Hands-on",
  "description": "Build and deploy a small API to Azure Container Apps.",
  "location": "Lab B110",
  "startsAtUtc": "2026-12-01T13:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 25
}

### Register for an event
POST {{host}}/api/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendeeName": "Jordan Student",
  "attendeeEmail": "jordan.student@example.com"
}

### List registrations for an event
GET {{host}}/api/events/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/registrations
